{"about_the_game":"Shadow Ninja: Apocalypse is a fast and unforgiving 2D action game where everything depends on your reaction and sense of rhythm.<br />\n<br />\nYou are a ninja in a ruined world. Traps, enemies and constant pressure surround you. Mistakes are not forgiven. Each run is an attempt to go further than before.<br />\n<br />\nThere are no complex systems here. Only movement, combat and survival.<br />\n<br />\nWhat\u2019s inside<br />\n<br />\n- Fast gameplay  <br />\nThe pace never lets you relax. You must stay focused at all times.<br />\n<br />\n- Simple controls  <br />\nEasy to start, hard to maintain consistent results.<br />\n<br />\n- Traps and enemies  <br />\nJumps, dodges and attacks flow into one continuous sequence.<br />\n<br />\n- Short sessions  <br />\nYou can play for a few minutes, but it\u2019s hard to stop.<br />\n<br />\n- \u201cOne more try\u201d effect  <br />\nEvery run makes you want to replay it better.<br />\n<br />\nThe core of the game<br />\n<br />\nYou don\u2019t explore the world.  <br />\nYou try to survive in it.<br />\n<br />\nAnd with each attempt, you become faster.","achievements":{"total":0},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/389160?t=1773994759","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/389160?t=1773994759","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/389160/05ebae59a57f0c441b79791169df65cb31778155/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773994759","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/389160/05ebae59a57f0c441b79791169df65cb31778155/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773994759","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"i